WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.792 --> 00:00:02.460
This is the kitchen.

00:00:02.544 --> 00:00:03.795
All right.

00:00:04.129 --> 00:00:05.296
Let's eat something.

00:00:06.006 --> 00:00:07.007
What do you want?

00:00:07.132 --> 00:00:07.966
Gyoza.

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:10.135
I know.

00:00:15.181 --> 00:00:18.977
Happy New Year.

00:00:21.354 --> 00:00:23.481
We're actually eating osechi.

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:25.316
Take your time.

00:00:26.151 --> 00:00:27.610
The herring roe is delicious.

00:00:30.989 --> 00:00:31.990
Nikaido.

00:00:33.241 --> 00:00:36.369
I've always wanted to tell you something.

00:00:36.995 --> 00:00:38.830
Thanks for being my friend.

00:00:40.331 --> 00:00:41.541
Don't be stupid.

00:00:41.624 --> 00:00:42.751
Why tell me this now?

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:47.213
Keep being my friend, no matter what.

00:00:47.338 --> 00:00:50.258
What do you mean?
That goes without saying.

00:00:54.596 --> 00:00:56.181
Caiman, listen.

00:00:57.057 --> 00:00:58.641
I need to tell you something--

00:00:58.725 --> 00:00:59.559
Hey!

00:01:00.393 --> 00:01:01.478
It's snowing.

00:01:03.563 --> 00:01:05.523
It's so pretty.

00:01:05.607 --> 00:01:06.566
Yes.

00:01:07.067 --> 00:01:09.360
Can I have this datemaki?

00:01:09.444 --> 00:01:10.403
Help yourself.

00:01:12.572 --> 00:01:13.531
It's delicious.

00:01:14.866 --> 00:01:16.367
Who are you?

00:01:19.037 --> 00:01:21.122
I'm Doctor Kasukabe.

00:01:21.206 --> 00:01:24.042
I'm doing research
on Sorcerers in this mansion.

00:01:24.125 --> 00:01:25.502
Wha--

00:01:25.585 --> 00:01:28.379
What?

